# Architecture

- One domain per folder: `features/auth`, `features/billing`, `features/moderation`. UI state that is not server data lives in Zustand. Server data lives in TanStack Query via `useAppQuery` / `useAppMutation`.
- Keep a file under 200 lines. Split a screen before adding another section.
- New routes are files in `app/`. Register tab screens in `app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx` and modal screens in `app/modal/_layout.tsx`.
- Forms use `CredentialsForm` patterns: typed inputs, `accessibilityLabel`, and a 48dp target.
- Empty, loading, and error states use `Skeleton`, `Text variant="muted"`, and `AppErrorBoundary`. Do not leave a blank screen.
- Haptics come from `Button` or `useHaptics`. Review prompts go through `recordPositiveMilestone`, only after a repeated success.

```tsx
// Good: screen calls a feature service
await saveCheckIn(value);

// Bad: screen owns the request
await supabase.from('checkins').insert({ value });
```
